Third-party content
-------------------

spec/upstream/ holds API specifications published by Openprovider B.V.:

  - spec/upstream/api-documentation/: files of
    https://github.com/openprovider/api-documentation at the commit pinned in
    spec/sources.json. That repository declares no license.
  - spec/upstream/developer-portal/swagger.spec.js: the specification served
    by https://developer.openprovider.com.

spec/openprovider.json, spec/conflicts.md and spec/error-codes.json are derived
from them and from the Openprovider knowledge base (https://openprovider.help).
The documentation comments of the generated code in src/Model and src/Service
quote descriptions from these specifications.

